## Context

PR #166 added `max_turns_housekeeping` to `ProjectConfig` with a cap in `__post_init__`
(capped at `2 × MAX_TURNS_HOUSEKEEPING = 80`). The analogous field `max_turns_pick_ticket`
was added earlier but has no corresponding cap — a beat.json overlay can set it arbitrarily
high without enforcement.

`scripts/beat.py` line 128–131:
```python
def __post_init__(self) -> None:
    cap = 2 * MAX_TURNS_HOUSEKEEPING
    if self.max_turns_housekeeping > cap:
        self.max_turns_housekeeping = cap
```

`max_turns_pick_ticket` (default 30) is not capped.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] `__post_init__` also caps `max_turns_pick_ticket` at `2 × MAX_TURNS_PICK_TICKET = 60`
- [ ] Docstring updated to mention the cap for both fields
- [ ] `make check` passes
